abstract: >-
  Cross-platform anti-reverse-engineering and anti-tamper building blocks for
  native (C/C++), Electron/JavaScript, Android, and .NET targets, with a
  threat-model analysis of automated AI reverse-engineering pipelines and an
  honest account of each defense's limitations.
